LanguageData.AA_OverchannelDesc:
When on, this mage can cast spells without enough mana by burning their own mind instead. The missing mana becomes arcane strain.

Strain hurts and fogs the mind, fades with rest, and makes the weave unstable: past 40 strain, every overchannelled cast can set off a wild surge with random effects. At {1} strain the mage burns out for a day.

